# Build context for the production Dockerfile: sources only, never local builds, secrets, data or
# test output. Anything listed here can never reach an image layer.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.claude

# Environment files and credentials (the templates are not needed in images either)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_*
**/*service-account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/.docker

# Database dumps and backups (may hold real student data)
**/backups
**/*.dump
**/*.dump.age
**/*.age
**/*.agekey
**/*.sql.gz

# Local working folders
reports
research_notes
**/*.log
